# Google Drive Integration Settings
# 1. Create a project at https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Enable the "Google Drive API"
# 3. Configure the "OAuth consent screen" (External user type, add yourself as a test user)
# 4. Create an "OAuth client ID" (Application type: Web application)
# 5. Add "https://localhost:5173" AND "https://[YOUR_IP]:5173" to "Authorized JavaScript origins"
#    Note: [YOUR_IP] is your computer's local IP (e.g., 192.168.1.50)
#    Note: HTTPS is now enabled for local development.
# 6. Copy the Client ID below:

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here

# Optional browser API key for corsproxy.io, used when direct RSS requests fail.
# Vite includes this value in the browser bundle. Use a key restricted to your app's domains.
VITE_CORSPROXY_KEY=
